      "finding": "https://api.example.com/",
      "explanation": "The code transmits data to an external API, which is an external transmission. This is a common practice and necessary for the skill's functionality. However, the lack of user confirmation and logging increases the risk.",
      "remediation": "Add user confirmation and logging as mentioned in the SQP-2 finding. Document these steps in the skill's description.",
      "code_snippet": "\n\ndef forecast(city):\n    url = \"https://api.example.com/v1/forecast\" + urllib.parse.urlencode({\"city\": city})\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers={\"Authorization\": \"Bearer \" + os.environ[\"WEATHER_API_KEY\"]})\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\n        return json.load(resp)",
